II. Methods
In this section, the methodology of the Conditional Diffusion Probabilistic model adopted
for the development of the EqDiff-CT framework is presented.
II.A. Conditional Diffusion Model for CBCT to CT Synthesis
The generative mechanism has been developed using DDPM formalization. The reference
CT image x0 ∈ RH×W is passed on through the model and progressively corrupted using


