dataset. The resulting model was then evaluated on the held out SynthRAD2025 test set.
This experimental design aims to assess whether EqDiff-CT can leverage physics-driven
artifact characteristics learned from phantom data and transfer them effectively to anatomi
cally realistic patient images. Phantom CBCT data provide controlled acquisition conditions
and well characterized artifact patterns, while the SynthRAD dataset introduces substantial
anatomical variability and more realistic imaging noise.
