IV.A. Main Findings
This study introduced EqDiff-CT, a conditional diffusion framework for synthetic CT gen
eration from CBCT images in head and neck radiotherapy. The main finding is that adding
rotational equivariance to an attention based enhanced diffusion model improves the quality
of CBCT to CT synthesis.
